WEBVTT

00:12:25.073 --> 00:12:30.329
The last few years have served us
some sobering truths about the workplace.

00:12:31.079 --> 00:12:34.249
But they've also given us
a chance to reimagine.

00:12:35.125 --> 00:12:37.377
Women of color are tired.

00:12:39.171 --> 00:12:40.798
RG: Aren’t you tired too?

00:12:41.799 --> 00:12:46.595
DP: This is our moment
to make work work for everyone.

00:12:47.596 --> 00:12:49.723
Let's remake the table together.

00:12:50.182 --> 00:12:51.350
Thank you.

00:12:51.850 --> 00:12:53.018
RG: Thank you.

00:12:53.018 --> 00:12:58.398
(Applause)